&lt;p&gt;I do not understand the directory &lt;tt&gt;odbc/README.txt&lt;/tt&gt;. Where is it located? I would rather type ralative from &lt;tt&gt;$IGNITE_HOME&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Vladimir.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15651279" author="isapego" created="Wed, 9 Nov 2016 15:52:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Vladimir, the problem is there are different paths for binary and source distributions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
